# React + TypeScript Patterns

- Use functional components with hooks
{{#if parameters.preferNamedExports}}
- Use named exports, not default exports
{{/if}}
- Keep components under {{parameters.componentMaxLines}} lines; extract subcomponents when larger
- Co-locate component-specific types with the component file
{{#if parameters.useTailwind}}
- Use Tailwind utility classes; avoid inline style objects
{{/if}}
- Extract custom hooks for reusable logic
- Prefer composition over prop drilling
